      "entries": [
        "The morrowkin tries to drain the motivation from its target, who must attempt a DC 31 Fortitude save. If the target fails, it is doomed 1 (doomed 2 on a critical failure) and must roll twice and use the worse result on all checks for 1 minute. Creatures wearing a hope talisman are unaffected."
