        "unit": "action",
        "number": 2,
        "symbol": "◆◆"
      },
      "traits": [
        "mental",
        "necromancy",
        "negative"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "The morrowkin inhales and draws forth the future deeds of all creatures around it. All creatures within a 30-foot emanation of the morrowkin take 6d8+18 mental damage and must attempt a DC 39 Will save. The morrowkin can't Swallow Future again for 1 minute. Creatures wearing hope talismans can choose to let their hope talisman break in order to ignore the effect after seeing the result of their Will save."
      ],
